# Deliberately committed (and deliberately empty).
#
# The image-volume deployment nests a writable `plans` emptyDir at
# .agents/plans INSIDE the read-only content mount. A read-only image
# layer cannot have that mount point created at mount time, so the
# directory must already exist in the content image — which means it must
# exist here, in the source tree the image is built from.
#
# See deploy/content.Dockerfile and deploy/base/50-deployment-daemon.yaml,
# which arrive with this recipe's deploy/ tree.
#
# record_plan derives plansDir = agentsDir + "/plans" (pkg/tools/record_plan.go).
# Locally the dir is created on demand; in the read-only image volume it
# must be pre-baked.
